            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.15.23"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "15:23",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela msirye nyama ambayo taimwagirwe mlatso, mana mlatso ni uhai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.9.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 9:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeyesi ndiyemuolaga myawe, kpwa kpweli nindamriphiza. Nyama yeyesi achiolaga mutu, au mutu aolage myawe, naye ni aolagbwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.9.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 9:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chisha Mlungu wagomba na Nuhu na anae achiamba, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.9.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Sambi naika chilagane changu na mwimwi phamwenga na vivyazi vyenu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.9.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 9:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na chila chiumbe mrichokala nacho melini, yani nyama a mapha, nyama a kufuga na chila nyama wa tsakani, yani viumbe vyosi virivyotuluka melini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.9.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 9:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ninaika chilagane changu namwi kukala takuna viumbe ndivyohoswa ni mafuriko tsona, yani takundakala na mafuriko ndigoangamiza dunia.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.9.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mlungu achienderera kugomba achiamba, “Hino ndiyo ishara ya chilagane changu namwi, na chila chiumbe chiricho moyo chiricho phamwenga namwi hadi vivyazi vyedzavyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.9.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 9:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naika chisichi cha mvula mainguni, nacho chindakala ishara ya chilagane changu kahi yangu na dunia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.9.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 9:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chila nchifwinika mlunguni na maingu, na hicho chisichi cha mvula chichionekana mainguni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.9.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 9:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nindatambukira chilagane changu na mwimwi na viumbe vyosi, kukala wakati wowosi madzi tagandakala tsona mafuriko ga kuhosa viumbe vyosi virivyo moyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.9.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 9:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chisichi chichikala mainguni, nindachiona na nindatambukira chilagane changu cha kare na kare kahi ya Mlungu na viumbe vyosi vya chila aina duniani.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.9.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.9.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 9:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.9.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.9.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 9:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mlungu achimuambira Nuhu, “Chisichi chichi ndiyo ishara ya chilagane ambacho náchiika na viumbe vyosi duniani.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.9.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.9.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 9:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.9.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.9.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 9:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anangbwa alume a Nuhu ariotuluka melini kala ni Shemu, Hamu na Jafeti. (Hamu kala ni isengbwa wa Kanani.) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.9.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.9.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 9:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hano ndio ana ahahu a Nuhu, na aho ndio akare a atu osi phapha duniani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.9.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.9.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 9:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.9.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.9.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 9:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuhu waandza kurima, achiphanda mizabibu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.9.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.9.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 9:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bada ya kunwa uchi wa zabibu, walewa na achilala chitsaha mwakpwe hemani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.9.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.9.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 9:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hamu, isengbwa wa Kanani, walola chitsaha cha ise na achendaambira nduguze airi okala kondze. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.9.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.9.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 9:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela Shemu na Jafeti ahala vwazi, achirigbwiririra mwao mafuzini, achiinjira chinyume-nyume na achendabwingiza ise yao. Aloza nyuso zao kanda, ili asione chitsaha cha ise yao.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.9.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.9.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
